      "title": {
        "en": "W tej bluzce"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "After *o* (about) and *w* (in), *ta bluzka* becomes *tej bluzce*: *co myślisz o tej bluzce?* (what do you think of this top?). With a masculine noun it is *tym*: *ładnie ci w tym kolorze* (that colour suits you). Instead of the noun, *w niej* (in it, for a feminine noun) and *w nim* (for a masculine one)."
      }
    }
  ],
